// re-reads it twice (`mov eax,[ebp+8]` / `add eax,-0x91` for the switch
// bias, then `mov esi,[ebp+8]` in the default arm) where our CL
// enregisters it once into edx and biases with `lea eax,[edx-0x91]`.
